  "details": "I have noticed that small angles on a phys bone results in grabbing and moving them around sometimes getting stuck.\nI have a baseball bat on my right hand and I can grab the bottom part of it with my left hand (so it looks like I’m holding it with both hands). I had the max angle really small because I didn’t want it to go trough my hand, while doing that I noticed that it’s sometimes getting stuck a certain angles, after setting the max angle to a higher value I noticed that it’s not getting stuck anymore.\nThis issue causes some trouble for me because it prevents me from actually using my baseball bat as it was intended.\nThe first gif shows a max angle of 20 and the second one shows a max angle of 45.",
